0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shippai mo myou ni CHAAMINGUComment: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:14.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes! We've got Super PowersComment: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:19.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes! We're the Super PowersComment: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:25.17,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes! We're the Super PowersComment: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:30.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes! We're the Super PowersComment: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:36.17,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes! We're the Super PowersComment: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.94,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,キミの夢｜ゆ#｜めは モンスター級｜きゅうでComment: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.73,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,胸｜む#｜ねの檻｜お#｜り ぶっ壊｜!こ#｜わしてはComment: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.15,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,飛｜とび込｜こむよ『Go to Hell』とComment: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.09,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,書｜かいた極｜パ#｜ラ楽｜ダイ園｜スComment: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:35.88,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,いつだってComment: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:46.08,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,傷｜き#｜ずだらけになった夢｜ゆ#｜めはいつかComment: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:51.37,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,大｜だ#｜い事｜!じな宝｜た#｜か#｜ら物｜!も#｜のになるさComment: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:55.02,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,不｜ふ思｜!し議｜!ぎな興｜こう奮｜!ふんが　仲｜な#｜か間｜!まを繋｜つ#｜なぐComment: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:58.01,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,懸｜けん命｜!めいに生｜いきる事｜こ#｜とComment: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.76,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,冒｜ぼう険｜!けんと呼｜よぼうかComment: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:06.20,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,最｜さい高｜!こうの夢｜ゆ#｜め信｜!し#｜んじあうComment: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:08.85,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ライバルとの絆｜<き#｜ず#｜なComment: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.64,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,失｜し敗｜っぱいも妙｜みょうに魅｜ちゃー力的｜ミグComment: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:25.31,Translation,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:25.31,Translation,,0,0,0,template furi,Comment: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.94,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Your dream is like a monsterComment: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:30.73,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Every time it breaks the cage in your heartComment: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Jump into the paradise on whichComment: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.09,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,is written "Go to Hell"Comment: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:35.88,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's always,Comment: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:46.08,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Someday, the dream that's covered in cuts and bruisesComment: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:51.37,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,will become your one and only treasureComment: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:55.02,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Magical excitement connects friendsComment: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:58.01,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Living your life to the fullestComment: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.76,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shall we call it an adventure?Comment: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:06.20,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Believing in a great dream togetherComment: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:08.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The bond with your rivalComment: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.64,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Even failure is strangely charmingDialogue: 0,0:01:36.33,0:01:38.33,Title,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:43.44,Title,,0,0,260,,Zero EscapeDialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be.Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:55.44,Main,,0,0,0,,No... No...Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:59.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro-san sacrificed himself...Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If only we were... if only we were...!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If only we were stronger...Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Our enemies are the ones who should be crying.Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.94,0:02:42.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We cannot allow ourselves to be upset.Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinbe-san!Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:51.36,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you say something so cruel?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because you spent the least amount of time with Pedro doesn't mean that...Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:58.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying that we shouldn't let our guards down!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We had our backs against the wall on that coastline...Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:10.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro knew that we were in a dangerous situation, and was prepared to sacrifice himself whenever necessary.Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro's victory!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:25.85,Main,,0,0,0,,How great of a loss has the enemy suffered because of your presence here?Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:31.32,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an unprecedented series of events for them!Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:36.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Your strength really drove Big Mom into a corner!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you hear Pedro's voice in your ears?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:46.22,Main,,0,0,0,,"Keep going!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy understood the stakes instantly...Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.70,0:04:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,and decided to take the enemy on all by himself.Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:11.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri has a bounty of over one billion! It's an all or nothing situation.Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:18.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We are still in Totto Land!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:25.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, the pirate queen of this country, Big Mom, will be on our tail!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,And her fleet could close in on us from all directions at any time!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So until we escape from Big Mom's territory...Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:42.85,Main,,0,0,0,,we must not let down our guard! Don't you hear Pedro saying that?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I was way out of line.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, give us directions!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:06.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun and the others will be sailing to us from Cacao Island...Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,so we need to make sure we don't miss them.Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a strong wind coming! It's a tailwind!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,So steer to starboard!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:15.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hard a-starboard!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.66,0:05:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll catch the wind on the starboard side and head straight west!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take a direct route!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go refill the cola we used!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll watch for enemies!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in position!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll help you monitor the sea currents!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming from six o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the ships from earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a person?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It can't be!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:04.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be.. that can't... that can't be possible!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is walking on the water!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:15.23,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! That's ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not water... It's...Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.76,Main,,0,0,0,,candy?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,She's walking on a large blob of moving candy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Using candy?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, does that mean...Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The only person capable of producing that...Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be... him-teia!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick...Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy Sea Slug!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did Zeus go?Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:55.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's his job to help Mama cross the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't be...Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:07:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But I suppose that's fine... because I have a score to settle with them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro sacrificed his own life!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm able to replace my right arm with candy, but...Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.11,0:07:22.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Every time my right arm is melted...Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:26.93,Main,,0,0,0,,when I'm enjoying my afternoon tea...Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:33.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll remember... that Jaguar Mink's face!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.59,0:07:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Napoleon? There's nothing more humiliating!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:42.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It is a grievous crime in this land.Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have no future here.Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:48.14,Main,,0,0,0,,How should I torment...Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,his companions to sate my rage!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:02.99,Captions,,0,0,175,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:02.99,Main,,0,0,1,,Huh? Why, why, why?Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone's gone!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I really wanna eat some flames! I'm losing my strength...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:14.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna eat thunderclouds, too...Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:19.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Within the Borders of Totto Land - At SeaDialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... So Lola-chan, who we met at Thriller Bark, was a master at making chocolate?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:28.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. Lola was the Minister of Chocolate on Cacao Island...Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:33.48,Main,,0,0,0,,but after she left, the position was never filled!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how come?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the presumed candidate here keeps rejecting the position.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.49,0:08:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Pudding?Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:45.78,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Because, to me...Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The only Minister of Chocolate for Chocolat Town should be Sister Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,And I've always hoped that she would return someday...Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but...Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Oh? Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Could I be mistaken?Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.53,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:08.22,Captions,,0,0,240,,Pound - The Father of Lola and ChiffonDialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:08.22,Main,,0,0,1,,I-I think that's my daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,She's gone now...Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:23.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon...Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come out from under there, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:31.26,Main,,0,0,0,,N... No way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a wedding dress right now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:37.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If I sit on the carpet with that man...Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:43.60,Main,,0,0,0,,people will think that we just got married to each other!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What people?Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:51.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You never know who's watching! And I'll be annoyed if they think it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It.. It'll... It'll really annoy me, okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:58.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the trouble. Just don't fall, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.39,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:07.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh! What a sweet man! He's worried about me!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?! Whether I fall or not isn't your business!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There's Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's start making the cake as soon as we arrive!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Did you hear what I said, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.67,Main,,0,0,0,,...-san!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:30.15,Captions,,0,0,170,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.16,Main,,0,0,1,,What an idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:32.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he broke the mirror himself!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:35.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to sacrifice yourself to let your friends escape?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're talking to?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama has a bounty of one billion, fifty-seven million belly!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the strongest of the Three Sweet Commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm following your lead on this...Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I doing it wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:28.24,Main,,0,0,0,,But... it's more efficient this way!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Katakuri-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama, that's so brutal!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:05.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose you understand now.Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,As I already told you... in terms of ability...Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:17.29,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do that I cannot.Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:21.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I have you beat in both speed and strength.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber won't lose to mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Stamp!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:54.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that it?Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.23,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.09,0:12:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,He disappeared again!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:12.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew Katakuri-sama was in a different league!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're trying strength next?Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Give up already.Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What a huge punch!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Elephant...Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:55.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama has an even bigger one!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that how you do...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.80,Main,,0,0,0,,your Elephant Gun?Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:44.62,Captions,,0,0,1,,Cacao IslandDialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:52.57,Main,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful in her wedding dress!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for her. Her wedding was ruined.Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.07,0:15:00.55,Main,,0,0,0,,But even with that sad look, she's still so beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's the Minister of Puffs!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Chi... Chiffon-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, don't worry! Sister Chiffon is not the primary culprit of the revolt!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.43,0:15:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The one at fault is her husband; "Gang" Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sister.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I told them that I'd threaten you and force you to help me make the cake.Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Pudding. That's the position I'm in now.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:44.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, Pudding-sama, I can't believe what happened today...Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.09,0:15:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Who could've expected such a happy wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,, to be ruined by Straw Hat Luffy's trespassing and Bege's betrayal?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That Sanji man ruined it, too!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What's done is done.Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:16:01.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama, I'm sure you're having a hard time!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama must be angry.Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:07.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's mad and hungry.Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,In addition, she's having Hunger Pangs and may very well destroy this country.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how horrible...Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Is everything ready?Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! About an hour ago, the 31 most renowned chefs from Whole Cake Island arrived here.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:38.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweets Factory - Chocolat TownDialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you, Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:48.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We're the 31 head chefs of Whole Cake Island!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We're the WCI 31!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister Chiffon and I will make the wedding cake that can stop Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Please help us.Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am! We've already made preparations!Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama was the bride, so she was affected the most by what happened...Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me! I'm not gonna let Mama destroy our country!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:23.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's overcoming the pain and overseeing the cake-making herself!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.71,0:17:26.30,Main,,0,0,0,,She's literally a goddess of salvation!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and go inside with Rabiyan.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:32.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, everyone! Listen to me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:38.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to do me a favor!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to risk our lives and bake the cake that will determine the fate of our country!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We really need to concentrate!Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,So, please don't look inside the factory under any circumstance while we're at it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:54.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:59.72,Main,,0,0,0,,And no matter who it is, don't let anyone look inside!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We understand! Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:14.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This way, they won't see Sanji-san...Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:18.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And now, I've got to deal with the ones who will be helping us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Head Chefs! Come inside one at a time!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Head chef of the First Kitchen, Buche, reporting for duty.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay still.Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna modify your memories...Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Edit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me down.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Here you go!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.05,Main,,0,0,1,,That must've been a tough ride.Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:58.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,Inside the FactoryDialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time, so I drew a blueprint of the cake on the way here.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You memorized it?Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.27,0:19:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Pretty much.Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! It's easy to remember the shape, but how could you know the ingredients without tasting it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,By smelling it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up! Every minute counts!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:27.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan's chef outfit is so cute!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:29.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama, are you all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Husband-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Come here!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I took out their memories of the incident earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:45.91,Main,,0,0,0,,in other words, they think the wedding finished without a hitch, and...Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,that w... we are... m... married!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.73,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,they think the wedding cake was ruined by unexpected weather.Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:01.79,Main,,0,0,0,,And that Mama was enraged, so the cake has to be remade quickly.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That is what they believe now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Their memories of making the cake are still fresh, so they'll be useful to us!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:18.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Who drew this blueprint and recipe for the wedding cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:20.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:22.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Husband-sama, you drew this?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:25.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let me know if there are any mistakes.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You even identified the hidden flavors...Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,that took Head Chef Streusen-sama a week to come up with!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.41,0:20:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard rumors you were skilled, but wow, you're amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,And by an odd coincidence, as husband and wife...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:43.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Husband and wife?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,..this cake will be your first project, strangely enough.Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. I'm a little embarrassed.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Husband and wife...Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Wife-sama?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:56.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,W... Wife...Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:57.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Wife-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Wife-sama! Wife-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, Wif..Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! She'll die!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:04.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He called us husband and wife! Oh my!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:09.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:12.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What? He suddenly said "Hey" to me!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:16.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not so bad to have an assertive husband...Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:20.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No, but it's important to start things right.Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I-If you act like my master, I'll kill you, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to gather these as fast as you can.Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.29,0:21:32.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Non-homogenized milk, sugar beets, bananas, black sesame...Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,roasted soy flour, yogurt. A lot of it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,...san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.97,0:21:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! It's a race against time until the cake is complete!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-chan, you bake the giant chiffon cake.Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:54.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, you handle all the chocolate tempering.Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:21:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You have two hours and forty minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It certainly is a fight against time.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,When we get there, I'll add my secret ingredient!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It can lead anyone to the peak of happiness...Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you taste true sweetness!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.92,Main,,0,0,0,,T-True sweetness?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,In three hours, we'll load the incomplete cake on a ship and leave Cacao Island.Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And as we let it cool down, we'll decorate it on the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:31.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we meet up with Luffy and the others being chased by Big Mom, on the Sunny...Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.86,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll finish making the greatest cake ever!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. That sounds efficient.Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.28,0:22:39.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But at that fast of a pace?Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.40,0:22:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it, that's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta do it! Do you want Mama to destroy the country?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! We'll follow you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:51.11,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's start baking!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:56.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,For those who saved Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,For Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.97,0:23:06.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll make my special extremely-fluffy chiffon cake!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:09.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I must help Sanji-san and the others get away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:12.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,With my very sweet chocolate!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:16.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Keep hanging on, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:19.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll show them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.02,0:23:22.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,My offensive cooking!Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.27,0:23:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring... Clank!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:29.10,Captions,,1000,0,345,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, it's me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:31.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You managed to survive, Brother Peros.Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:33.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, barely.Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.65,0:23:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard Pedro...Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,died so pathetically!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! You were there, weren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.91,0:23:52.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose he sacrificed his life to try and kill me...Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,but I'm very much alive, as you can probably tell.Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:59.73,Main,,0,0,0,,So he died for no reason! Right?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.73,0:24:04.45,Main,,0,0,0,,And now you're going to die in vain too, just like Pedro.Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.45,0:24:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let him kill you already? Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.15,0:24:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Straw Hat's friends?Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.67,0:24:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Believe or not...Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.84,0:24:15.52,Main,,0,0,0,,they launched their ship into the air and escaped our encirclement.Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.52,0:24:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm chasing them with Mama now...Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.34,0:24:21.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We're walking on the water.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:26.22,Main,,0,0,0,,They're tenaciously trying to flee... but we'll catch up to them soon.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Amande and the others' fleet will be here soon, too.Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.89,0:24:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée.Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.99,0:24:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, Big Brother...Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:43.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan on sleeping? Our soldiers can't go anywhere if you keep doing that.Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.39,0:24:44.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought he might have been able to protect his crew with all of that vigor he's got, but...Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,this is the current state of their captain.Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.40,0:24:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Take those soldiers and go set fire or something to Straw Hat's ship.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sister Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:59.43,Main,,0,0,1,,We found a mirror that goes to Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:25:01.50,Captions,,0,500,200,,Mascarpone 34th Son of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:25:01.50,Captions,,500,0,120,,Joscarpone 29th Daughter of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:24:59.43,0:25:01.50,Main,,0,0,1,,There must be one or two more!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's shoot flaming arrows at Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.17,0:25:11.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope they taken out by Mama while in a frenzy from the fire.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.62,0:25:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yikes!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.53,0:25:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me that mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.24,0:25:23.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:28.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you wanted to have a one-on-one duel with me, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what you get!Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.01,0:25:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, burn down Straw Hat's ship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.39,0:25:48.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Joscar?Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I am, Mascar.Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:26:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, shoot them!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.35,0:26:06.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.91,0:26:18.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you stop.Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.81,0:26:25.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave my precious younger brother and sisters alone!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.68,0:26:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,A mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.37,0:26:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:46.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.91,0:26:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, respond!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:53.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,At Sea - Totto LandDialogue: 0,0:27:03.94,0:27:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Can you hear me?! Somebody!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.85,0:27:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.62,0:27:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's me! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still some mirrors on the ship, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.64,0:27:16.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe in the mens' bedroom or the bathroom?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's burning up!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna shoot, Joscar.Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.91,0:27:30.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are, Mascar.Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.51,0:27:34.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It's burning! It's burning!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:38.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy?! What'd you say about mirrors?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.79,0:27:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Break them all! To pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.13,0:27:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?! How will you come back if we do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know... but I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll figure something out!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.74,0:27:54.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff...Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.83,0:27:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I smell something!Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a nose, though!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.56,0:28:03.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The bathroom is on fire!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:12.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Flaming arrows from inside the mirror! Cannon shots from behind!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:24.35,Main,,0,0,0,,One thing after the other! My eyes are spinning!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.35,0:28:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't have eyes that can spin!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, let's put it out, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.20,0:28:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, you guys, keep shooting!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.10,0:28:37.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna keep shooting, Joscar.Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:40.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are, Mascar.Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.27,0:28:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.13,0:28:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.90,0:28:52.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.59,0:28:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Those of you who'll march into the ship... follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.04,0:29:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.15,0:29:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Hurry up and break the mirrors! All of them!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.80,0:29:13.93,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.93,0:29:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Our enemies are sending an army your way! I can't stop them by myself!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.76,0:29:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me focus just on this guy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.79,0:29:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.09,0:29:34.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! We have a problem!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.05,0:29:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't get away!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.19,0:29:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A high wave!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.13,0:29:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you there...?Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:30:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.23,0:30:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.12,0:30:10.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! What's wrong?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.07,0:30:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,We...Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,might be done for...Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.53,0:30:21.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:07.40,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,We'veDialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:07.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:07.54,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gotDialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:07.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,SuDialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:07.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.30,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,perDialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:08.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,PDialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:08.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:08.66,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,PowDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:08.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:08.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:08.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:09.43,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ersDialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:11.84,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:11.94,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:11.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:11.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:11.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:11.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:12.51,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:12.21,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.21,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.21,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:12.21,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,vDi